; iter-92: moved from "above viewport center" to "top-center anchored
; at y=80" so the title sits on the dark cavern roof, with the painted
; arch stones framing it from below.
;
; iter-93: removed TitleHairline{Top,Bottom} — they crowded the title
; against the subtitle for no visual payoff (the painted backdrop's own
; archway frame supplies the "manuscript page" structure). More vertical
; breathing room between title and tagline.
